OL,3,GNEWSA'She never forgot her roots' -
OL,4,Ahometown and school tributes to Ciara
OL,5,AMageean
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer European champion and two-time
OL,8,FOlympian Ciara Mageean has been
OL,9,Fdescribed as "selfless" by staff from
OL,10,Fher former school.
OL,12,FMageean, from Portaferry in County
OL,13,FDown, was diagnosed with stage four
OL,14,Fbowel cancer in May 2025.
OL,16,FShe died on Sunday morning, surrounded
OL,17,Fby her loved ones, a statement posted
OL,18,Fon her social media accounts said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
