OL,3,GNEWSA'She never forgot her roots' -
OL,4,Ahometown and school tributes to Ciara
OL,5,AMageean
OL,6,
OL,7,FMarcelle Orsi, vice-principal of
OL,8,FAssumption Grammar School in
OL,9,FBallynahinch, said the loss will be
OL,10,Ffelt "by so many for many years to
OL,11,Fcome".
